### Job 1 -> saves jobId
POST http://localhost:8083/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{employerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Java Microservices Developer",
  "location": "Toronto, ON",
  "jobType": "FULL_TIME",
  "minSalary": 90000,
  "maxSalary": 130000,
  "description": "Build microservices with Java, Spring Boot and Kafka.",
  "remote": true,
  "requiredSkills": ["Java", "Spring", "Kafka"]
}

> {% client.global.set("jobId", response.body.id); %}

### Job 2 -> saves jobId2
POST http://localhost:8083/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{employerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Frontend Developer",
  "location": "Vancouver, BC",
  "jobType": "CONTRACT",
  "minSalary": 70000,
  "maxSalary": 100000,
  "description": "React and TypeScript.",
  "remote": false,
  "requiredSkills": ["React", "TypeScript"]
}

> {% client.global.set("jobId2", response.body.id); %}

### Missing description -> 400
POST http://localhost:8083/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{employerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Invalid Job",
  "location": "Toronto, ON",
  "jobType": "FULL_TIME",
  "minSalary": 50000,
  "maxSalary": 60000
}